// Cloudflare Workers static assets (the current form of Cloudflare Pages).
// No Worker code runs: the judged site is plain static files, so it never sleeps on idle
// and never depends on a backend. Missing files return a real 404 (no SPA fallback):
// the app uses hash routing, and the data layer relies on 404 to show a [V2 10020]
// "unavailable" state instead of parsing an HTML fallback as JSON.
{
  "name": "landfall",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-11-13",
  "assets": {
    "directory": "./dist"
  }
}
